{"ID":"20230926153338-13ga3fx","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230926153338-13ga3fx","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926153338-13ga3fx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926153344-vdvpakz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926153345-9injybr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926153345-9injybr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"【理中丸】","type":"doc","updated":"20230926153345"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230926153344-vdvpakz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926153344-vdvpakz","updated":"20230926153344"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：人参三两、干姜三两、甘草三两、白术三两"}]},{"ID":"20230926153344-e08tm0v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926153344-e08tm0v","updated":"20230926153344"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右四味，捣筛，蜜和为丸，如鸡子黄大，以沸汤数合和一丸，研碎温服，日三服，夜二服，腹中未热，可益至三四丸。"}]},{"ID":"20230926153344-2q0oqaf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926153344-2q0oqaf","updated":"20230926153344"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"理中丸加减法：若脐上筑者，肾气动也，去术加桂四两。吐多者，去术，加生姜三两。下多者，还用术；悸者，加茯苓二两。渴欲得水者，加术，足前成四两半。腹中痛者，加人参，足前成四两半。寒者，加干姜，足前成四两半。腹满者，去术，加附子一枚。服汤后，如食顷，饮热粥一升许，微自温，勿发揭衣被。"}]},{"ID":"20230926153345-9injybr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926153345-9injybr"}}]}